      "id": "MJUe",
      "code_hash": "635f1de61ed933dca461c3cedd0d2cbb",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"grpo-on-qwen25-3b-instruct-marimo-molab-port\">GRPO on Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct (marimo / Molab port)</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Marimo port of the official Unsloth Qwen2.5-3B GRPO notebook (<a href=\"https://github.com/unslothai/notebooks\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/unslothai/notebooks</a>, commit recorded in <em>Run provenance</em> below). Licensed <a href=\"https://github.com/unslothai/notebooks?tab=LGPL-3.0-1-ov-file#readme\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">LGPL-3.0</a>; Unsloth: <a href=\"https://unsloth.ai/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://unsloth.ai/</a>.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The model, GSM8K data prep, reward functions and GRPO config (250 steps) are unchanged from upstream. Adaptations for marimo / Molab: dependencies pinned in the script header instead of <code>!pip</code>, unique variable names across cells, training behind a run button, and the LoRA / logs written outside the repo. Added: run provenance, before/after generations, and a reward plot.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "vblA",
      "code_hash": "43387a4c3b23d171b018fc8534a37fab",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"installation\">Installation</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">One cell installs a single, consistent stack with the upstream pins (<code>transformers==4.57.6</code>, <code>trl==0.22.2</code>, <code>vllm==0.15.1</code>) and the CUDA 12.8 build of <code>torch==2.9.1</code> that <code>vllm==0.15.1</code> requires. Molab's GPU image ships a newer CUDA 13 torch that no vllm release compatible with <code>transformers==4.57.6</code> supports, so the stack is installed explicitly. It is skipped if everything is already at these versions. Installed versions are recorded in <em>Run provenance</em> below.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
