            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Sampling uses temperature 0.8, so single generations are noisy and the model is not always correct after only 250 steps. Training for longer or with a longer sequence length would help further.</span></span>"
